@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Feature 003 - One Ranking Function for UI and CSV
actor Teacher
participant "Current Activity" as Current
participant "History Detail" as History
participant "Existing useActivity / Owner Socket" as Live
participant "Saved detail reader" as Saved
participant "AnswerOrderPanel" as Panel
participant "deriveAnswerOrder" as Order
participant "CSV encoder" as Csv
Teacher -> Current : View current accepted answers
Current -> Live : existing subscription
Live --> Current : complete teacher snapshot
Current -> Panel : questions, all groups, submissions
Teacher -> History : Select own history
History -> Saved : owner-protected detail
Saved --> History : saved snapshot
alt waiting / active original activity
  History -> Live : subscribe original activity, same auth context
  Live --> History : revisions within 2 seconds
  opt ended or no longer current
    History -> Saved : one guarded refresh; no reopen / retry loop
  end
else ended history
  History -> History : use saved immutable answers
end
History -> Panel : effective teacher snapshot
Panel -> Order : validate and derive, no mutations
Order -> Order : global sequence sort once\nper-question dense rank\nall configured groups minus answered
Order --> Panel : all + per-question entries / unanswered
Teacher -> Panel : All receipts / By question + select
Panel --> Teacher : explicit global sequence vs question rank\nfull group + labeled complete item answers
Csv -> Order : same validated input
Order --> Csv : identical ordering for every grouped subrow
note over Order,Csv
Question group has ONE submission order for all items.
Unknown / duplicate / incomplete data is an error, never empty padding.
Unjoined configured groups are unanswered, ordinal only.
end note
note over Live
Student DTO and visibility unchanged.
Account / boot changes invalidate old requests and subscriptions.
end note
@enduml
